SOAPBOX: My Saturday this weekend was unusually wide open for playing
SOAPBOX: radio. I started out with a goal to beat last year, which I did.
SOAPBOX: The contest started out with a bang when I worked Australia and
SOAPBOX: India back-to-back on 20 meters. India was an ATNO, so that was
SOAPBOX: cool! I got another VU on 15 meters later. I used the Online
SOAPBOX: Scoreboard as my motivation when things got slow, or I started
SOAPBOX: zoning out, which can easily happen to me with FT4/FT8. It was
SOAPBOX: tough going up against so many stations running high power. A
SOAPBOX: great time was had by all!
